## Relevant Files
- Source/PoF/Combat/HitDetect.h
- Source/PoF/Combat/HitDetect.cpp

Start by reading these files to understand the current implementation.

## Task: Improve "Hit detection"

Current status: **partial** (current quality: 3/5)

### What needs to be done
Add TSet dedup and clamp overlaps per swing.

Implement all the improvements listed above. Work through them methodically — read existing code first, then make targeted changes. The goal is to bring this feature to production quality (5/5).

## Wiring Requirements
For EVERY artifact you generate, make it runnable out-of-the-box — do not stop at "it compiles":
